      "source_fingerprint": "ab06398a99af9123b2e8569586e14814f9294f6ba349ca22d03858320d11daef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a1f4cef32281af4df5105f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会反超给你们看的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "898056f81c33a4ed1656b8813ebdbb37cb2bc1cc20525db6afa55a05293d07ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7060d6a650254b6b86300e12",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身处困境——身处逆境才是胜机！",
      "source_fingerprint": "47a317113f2481842b1c55d514461edd190b889836d718e8f8dc0cecbf9f76b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1247d3f6ec62d15566eb77be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是毫不犹豫、勇往直前的结果！",
      "source_fingerprint": "36d0a3740cf1a23a90f5804c467ebaa48d387b9fce98dd46a3ff8f1f2e3908f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b60124175f9c01d7c79fcfe9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就这样直接飞往南方的岛屿♪怎么样？",
      "source_fingerprint": "965a74fddb97c80c6a51298da27925e7407e96e6dd9617c4687a081d7f7d1ce0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e1811f124a8975de0810f29",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是毫不犹豫、勇往直前的结果哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "93cebddc3e1cf1471f87755e9f539f2d4eb3680e22283713f4c6bd5a9f0c7e58",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:929d21c3207b7e6969c566f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "该我上场了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f07926d47d1b6622012ff2a384d7be5e474cba105522d1b4443f83860242ef4b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:341879d0f70240b049b12fdf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让你见识一下我的魔法！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f8b88fd8a7795e4ae0d4d59ff3eb38aaeffae703604bf9a4165aeff00a3c4e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8c1ef6272c935bb9d0aed06",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这里有个小道消息♪广场上的喷泉啊，\n光影效果会随着时间改变哦。\n……那曾让我觉得像是通往梦想的入口。",
      "source_fingerprint": "084703674b3bab9a79387f942fb340ecd47173f38ec0fc797f691256c298307b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "400000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1a80f01cc8a30d0f12c9547",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大吉大利、恭喜發財、萬事如意…\n是些吉利的词哦。\n我会连同签名一起写给你哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9eb197c0435507f107150198b194307ebb28aadbb47f809ed96ddf665ff4fc38",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "400004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08cd2f6f303066fb252084f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说只戴墨镜就不会暴露身份什么的，\n这种迷信……到底是哪里传出来的……？\n无论怎么想都太不切实际了呢……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d0b8807999846857c33a524e8fc20ae04cecc3ef188b30eba081b32a01f71d9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "400006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79121ea6fdaed44768805837",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "The Crown's Show!\n请欣赏这场最棒的奇观！\n也就是我摘得桂冠的瞬间！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f95638db77782f3da67e8d06380ad8915e9db56053df6e70465bf75f587d51a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7abe6a2295a4740eeb498d4b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我们放飞自我吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c57dccad52a0175fe93f256929b17573781bf874e2e644a49207b859d7a4965c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa89bbd8b626e4f92e1a8b0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欢迎来到闪耀至彼方的乐园！\n我要让它成为一场永不落幕的假期♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "20873dab7c383a83c399cea21954ad51e78fc4530491a64ecb0ff2715753f50d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ca1f96cb8b98baf547d4d8a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "准备好嗨起来了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f2af42fd942f7a0fb5056520f6d3da5bdfe2a8afffc878d64497f80204aeccf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3563418bdb94880c9988ed8b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会比任何人都要完美，\n比任何人都要闪耀！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a90ffcc5a71bececca6e469f5a4a7283fae30e9bb3268db57e123a249caaf077",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b677c8cb979e7e61612d1d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会回应期待的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "061ac4c0da486603f9c85d72b5a8a23a13c1b01deb14f1654990665b58a17bcc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6216c51cba000691b5d930bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "多亏了你我才明白。\n身边有一位有能力的助手，\n是多么令人安心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea7a9e2d7d358b37d35e5f88fea0bccf379ce8c5c2a89195edc20c263dcb37c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f440664963892a94bac17163",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "兼具整洁感与华丽感，\n真是个不错的设计呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3809f3df5b95c842f76243bb8409012c948d4d8a3bc34de67e5e810728ed18a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42cf0c856652b1bbe659e90c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "歌唱和舞蹈我也很喜欢哦。尤其是\n大家神情变得生动的那个瞬间。",
      "source_fingerprint": "26fe8b7320d571e7d62d5e38f1091144e3aa9da15e03d4b29542fa2387eac6f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31530bc07dc70cdd14046f95",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每一个细节都精雕细琢，\n这是能让我最闪耀的服装！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca08561cdc2c3f4485b84342529eb190d9264ce7419170933d1a2ebc7d2659d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39511fb7ea49a5310cdb982b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "缝制得很细致呢……\n是向哪家厂商订购的呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2d7e7178dab7c07e72eb37a39f87cf5386215859f0c482a3ca21e58b0ad91bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1bebfd39f8da2f4a8459b9a0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "得确认一下舞步才行。\n……因为偶尔，会不小心搞砸呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e113a14ab27114e37cc10955ec69ca39397f274eb92b36aca4c78b11db1862b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c4350a1b7f36c970fba62f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "绝对不放弃，绝不妥协！\n穿上这身衣服，我就会更加打起精神！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a813253e19893dd7f224d5b763c97849b07e62eabc087adc54dfb34544771c14",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9248e0dc47d7ca6c28da6cb0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论是大海还是比赛，我都要拿第一！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8173d1aa6365dce97c35ccab595ba783191a8753a3a7323f5537b564e47888b0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b42cc3c161e89ad40d8c4a16",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来，喝杯杨枝甘露休息一下吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "11fc62852700a762b927db3c2570d4f51edb740d291d8d63e261604f380106d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a9af8e82fd0f5b0644ffb07",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个设计也很好呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "746c87498be57cad88dfd42982483505e4a8fc68590645092815d5c80c6cab02",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d85d727f81f291a19ecc7f5f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喜欢的衣服\n越来越多了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "29b8413d2a259a1de043e34be7cac7ff7eae622c98cada2e861be28e666496aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4424fe4e9eb9d5b36cba2f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了能随时应对他人的目光，\n我彻底做好了仪容管理。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3178534c55fc7fbc4a8086a37a14057cdbaf3ccb6fdb43e3aee937da466e6579",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a424762091303c6ae58d87ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "饰品是母亲帮我选的。\n说是为了增添一份华丽感呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4df1242b6fe734c3f0bc6a7263ea0ed2d7f20cd44654edd7bfcbf4f106fad8b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb7eac4008ead90a1de85228",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "兼具整洁感与华丽感，\n真是个不错的设计呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3809f3df5b95c842f76243bb8409012c948d4d8a3bc34de67e5e810728ed18a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
